\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Weibull (left) and Erlang (right) distributions for various shapes as well as their respective probability density function. The respective Weibull and Erlang shapes are $\beta $ and n. The respective Weibull and Erlang rates are $\eta $ and $\theta $, and were set to fix the esperance of the distribution to 1. Line colors are set according to the value of the coefficient of variation CV (standard deviation / mean) of the given distribution.}}{8}{}\protected@file@percent }
